   "item_id": 237247,
   "item_text": "Click for solution",
   "item_forum_id": 0,
   "item_type": "post_hidden",
   "in_feed": null,
   "is_watched": null,
   "item_score": "992",
   "id": "27525",
   "item_level": "992",
   "post_data": {
    "post_id": 237247,
    "post_type": "forum",
    "topic_id": 37597,
    "poster_id": 3590,
    "post_rendered": "To finish things off, here's a construction with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/0/cb098dba3ff60bb83c6fc290a417e690b65988d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T=7$\"  width=\"46\" height=\"12\" > and 14 questions overall<br>\n<br>\nLabel the contestants by points <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/7/887919dfbc86eebc29e0373f98f97dbf23a0ae23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(i,j)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" >,</span> <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/5/e25410f1bf5abb8f1d49501bc676753f7958171a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq i \\leq 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" >,</span> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/4/3d46bbf15e1cda0ff440c851a7f5fd57d31895a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq j \\leq 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" ><br>\n<br>\nLet one question be solved by all contestants of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/c/15c3f05305395b8756be66966b479a1704b760c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(i, ai+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" > for each <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e50b29344d5ed72d1f2034d54d5366ef128ad5c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq a \\leq 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" >,</span> <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/d/f4d253a3986ca9b35effd9ee9298efeff5716902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq b \\leq 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" >.</span><br>\n<br>\nThe 10th question is solved by all contestants where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/3/4e329e6f641239c30d5390cef44f42e46a7d1310.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i \\in \\{2, 5\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" ><br>\nThe 11th question is solved by all contestants where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/9/309273fa117a4f8d783e41684a9db96e091030c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i \\in \\{3, 6\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" ><br>\nThe 12th question is solved by all contestants where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/2/6a2b08b240522f3b1abbc5e2aa52a47ec76d3511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i \\in \\{1, 4\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" ><br>\nThe 13th question is solved by all contestants where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/6/30680131451d79fb1803753a344c625c5aa55483.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i \\in \\{1, 7\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" ><br>\nThe 14th question is solved by all contestants where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/4/f0461ffa0208f25a3aa3f0f74b3e339c7544ba61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i \\in \\{4,7\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" >",
    "post_canonical": "To finish things off, here's a construction with $T=7$ and 14 questions overall\r\n\r\nLabel the contestants by points $(i,j)$, $1 \\leq i \\leq 7$, $1 \\leq j \\leq 3$\r\n\r\nLet one question be solved by all contestants of the form $(i, ai+b)$ for each $1 \\leq a \\leq 3$, $1 \\leq b \\leq 3$.\r\n\r\nThe 10th question is solved by all contestants where $i \\in \\{2, 5\\}$\r\nThe 11th question is solved by all contestants where $i \\in \\{3, 6\\}$\r\nThe 12th question is solved by all contestants where $i \\in \\{1, 4\\}$\r\nThe 13th question is solved by all contestants where $i \\in \\{1, 7\\}$ \r\nThe 14th question is solved by all contestants where $i \\in \\{4,7\\}$",
    "username": "kevinatcausa",
    "post_number": 5,
    "post_format": "bbcode",
    "category_name": "High School Olympiads",
    "category_id": 6,
    "poster_avatar": "//avatar.artofproblemsolving.com/avatar_3590.png"
   }
